 The original response remains available. Evidence maps, multiple suggestions,
 required acknowledgements and executable suggestions retain their normal
 type checks.
+
+## Coupled-status ownership
+
+`spiral coupled-status --run-dir PATH` is a read-only operator view of the native
+iteration manifest and durable `state/tui-work.json` ledgers. It owns no persisted
+state and does not alter the scheduler, ledgers, or provider configuration. The
+manifest remains the source of iteration limits, lifecycle flags, and recorded
+aggregate totals; each ledger remains the source of durable wire and task request
+counts. Missing interrupted-ledger usage is represented as unknown (`null`), not
+zero. The report describes recorded native completion only; it is not an
+independent verification or promotion authorization.
